.TH "CHAIN COMMAND"
The chain command gives miscellaneous information about a specific chain
including number of unowned shares, stock price, size of the chain,
and the holdings of all investors in the chain.
.s3
The general form of the command is:
.EX "chain [ chain_name ]"
Note that this command can be abbreviated to a single letter, (as can
all FF commands).
.NF
